<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id">- Kwele Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Habakuki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Habakuki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habakuki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hab</para>
  <para style="mt">Habakuki</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino china ulotezi wa Habakuki. Chitabu cha Habakuki hachilingile fana vitabu vimwenga va ulotezi, kwaviya chabule usenga uwasonhele wanhu wa Isilaili hebu wanhu wa Yuda. Mbali china mbuli mbili za kuiyalala na mbuli Habakuki ziyampulile Mulungu. Mulungu iviya kokwidika mbuli ziya zoyaiyalale. Wasomi wogesa kuwa Habakuki kakala lusita lumwe na Yelemia na iviya lusita lwa utawala wa Mfalume Yosia na Mfalume Yehoyakimu. Muna ichitabu chino hebu chitabu chimwenga chili muna Ibibiliya hachilongile Habakuki kakala lusita lulihi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Habakuki kaiyalala kwa Mulungu kawona tibwilitibwili na usede mbali Mulungu hamwidike Habakuki viyampulile yamtaze. Yodahika Habakuki kawona mbuli zino zitendeka muna isi ya Yuda. Mulungu kedika kwa kulonga kuwa kawenula Wababeli wawanange wanhu wa Yuda. Maabaho Habakuki kaiyalala kuwa Mulungu kakala yowasang'hanila wanhu wehi kuwatagusa wanhu haweli wehi ng'hani. Mulungu kamwidika kuwa iviya Wababeli wezahumizigwa na kutagusigwa hamwande. Kuuhelelo Habakuki kompula Mulungu yasang'hane chinhu na yalaguse ubazi. Komtogoza Mulungu kwa mbuli ng'hulu zoyatendile umwaka.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1:1-4 ina mbuli za mwanduso za kuiyalala kwa Habakuki.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 1:5-11, chosoma Mulungu viyamwidike.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Sula ya 1:12 mbaka sula ya 2:1 zofambula kusonhela Habakuki viyaiyalale mwanza wekaidi.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Sula ya 2:2-20 Mulungu komwidika mwanza wekaidi.</para>
  <para style="io">5. Sula ya 3 ina mbuli ziya Habakuki ziyampulile Mulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAB 1" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 1:1" />Malaguso ya Mulungu yoyawonile mulotezi Habakuki.<verse eid="HAB 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habakuki koiyalala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 1:2" />Vino weye Mndewa Mulungu, nizakupula unitaze mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:2">Vino weye hulonda kuhulika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:2">Nolila kwaviya nowona usede chila hanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:2">mbali hulonda kuchikombola!<verse eid="HAB 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 1:3" />Habali konitenda niwone mbuli zihile na mbuli za usede?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:3">Ubananzi na usede va kuulongozi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:3">Ndwagi na kuibishila volawilila.<verse eid="HAB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 1:4" />Malagilizo yabule nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:4">wanhu hawahumiza voilondeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:4">Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wowazunguluka wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:4">ivo nhaguso yoilavigwa hailavigwa voilondeka bule.<verse eid="HAB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu komwidika Habakuki</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 1:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Zilole zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:5">lola na wazanywe ng'hani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:5">Kwaviya niye notenda mbuli muna zisiku za ugima wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:5">na hwizatogola hata uhalongiligwa.<verse eid="HAB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 1:6" />Kwaviya nizawagala Wababeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:6">weli wasede na weli na himahima kufosa wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:6">wawo wofosa muna izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:6">muladi wasole iisi haili yawo.<verse eid="HAB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 1:7" />Wanhu wawo wodumbigwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:7">wotenda viwolonda wenyewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:7">Wawo wozindilila malagilizo yawo muhala.<verse eid="HAB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 1:8" />Falasi wawo wahuha kufosa duma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:8">wakali kufosa mbwizi weli na nzala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:8">Watowang'hondo wakwelafalasi wolawa kutali na wokimbila himahima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:8">Woguluka himahima fana viya masumula viyoiyoha yaje.<verse eid="HAB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 1:9" />Wose wokwiza kutenda ndwagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:9">Mabumbila yawo ya usede yogenda kuulongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:9">Woduganya mateka wengi fana msanga.<verse eid="HAB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 1:10" />Wowazeha wafalume</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:10">na wowehula watawala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:10">Woyazeha mabululu yose yeli na mhongono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:10">wotenda misugulu ya ulongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:10">muladi wakwele na kuyateka mabululu yayo.<verse eid="HAB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 1:11" />Maabaho wofosa fana vulavumbi na wogenda kuulongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:11">wotenda ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:11">kwaviya mulungu wawo niiyo nguvu yawo.”<verse eid="HAB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habakuki koiyalala kaidi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 1:12" />Vino weye siyo Mndewa Mulungu kwandusila umwaka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:12">Weye Mndewa Mulungu niiyo Mulungu wangu welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:12">hachizadanganika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:12">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kuwasagula Wababeli wachihumize!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:12">Weye luwe lwetu lwa kuwagangamiza muladi wachitaguse!<verse eid="HAB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 1:13" />Weye kwela ng'hani, hudaha kulola ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:13">hudaha kufunyila umoyo kulola mbuli zihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:13">Lelo habali kowawona wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile na huwatenda chochose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:13">Habali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wowakomeleza wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile kufosa wawo na konyamala?<verse eid="HAB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 1:14" />Kuwatenda wanhu kuwa fana somba muna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:14">fana viya vilumbe wotambala welibule mulangulizi.<verse eid="HAB 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 1:15" />Wehi wokwiza kuwalowa wanhu kwa ndwano zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:15">wowabululila kunze kwa nyavu zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:15">wowaduganya wose muna imigono yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:15">maabaho wodeng'helela na wonogelwa.<verse eid="HAB 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 1:16" />Ivo wozilavila nhambiko nyavu zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:16">na kusomela ubani migono yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:16">kwaviya kwa nyavu zawo wokala kwa utajili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:16">kuno woja ndiya inogile.<verse eid="HAB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 1:17" />Vino hawezaleka kukwega upinde wawo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:17">Vino wezagendelela kunamata wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:17">na kuwananga wanhu wa zisi zimwenga bila kuwawonela ubazi?<verse eid="HAB 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAB 2" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 2:1" />Nizakwima hanhu hangu ha kusungulila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:1">Nizakala kuna dilingo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:1">Nizakwima muladi nilole mbuli yondayanilongele Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:1">na viya vondayedike kusonhela kulongelela kwangu.<verse eid="HAB 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu komwidika Habakuki kaidi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 2:2" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kanidika na kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:2">“Yandika mbuli zino zonikulagusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:2">Uzandike vinogile muna ivibawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:2">muladi munhu yadahe kusoma vinogile.<verse eid="HAB 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 2:3" />Malaguso yano yogozela lusita lupangigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:3">malaguso ya kweli kusonhela uhelelo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:3">Yahakalama uyagozele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:3">kweli yezafika bila kukalama.<verse eid="HAB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 2:4" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu, nowalema wanhu weli na magoda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:4">Mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezakala kwa kumuhuwila Mulungu.<verse eid="HAB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 2:5" />Divai yokwagiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:5">munhu yeli na magoda hahumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:5">kana nzala ya kumela wanhu fana kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:5">fana viya ifa viili haiguta chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:5">Koduganya zisi zose kuwa zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:5">na wanhu wose kuwa wake.<verse eid="HAB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 2:6" />Chila munhu kezamwehula munhu yalingile ivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:6">na kezamtungila mbuli za kumwehula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:6">‘Kwizagaya weye uimemezela vinhu vili siyo vako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:6">na kusola lehani vinhu va wanhu, mbali hubweleza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:6">Vino kwizagendelela kutenda ivo mbaka zuwaki?’<verse eid="HAB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 2:7" />Siku dimwe wanhu wakwazime wezakwizila kwa kusinhukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:7">waja wokugudemeza wezalamka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:7">Maabaho kwizakuwa mateka wawo.<verse eid="HAB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 2:8" />Weye kuziteka zisi nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:8">mbali wanhu wondawasigale wezakuhoka weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:8">kwaviya kumkoma munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:8">na kubananga mabululu na wanhu wose wokala umo.<verse eid="HAB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 2:9" />Kwizagaya weye upata vinhu vingi kwa kubamanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:9">Kuzenga kaye inogile ng'hani muladi wike goya vinhu vako.<verse eid="HAB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 2:10" />Kwaviya kuilunga kuwananga wanhu wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:10">kuluguma chinyala lukolo lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:10">na weye mwenyewo kwizakomigwa.<verse eid="HAB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 2:11" />Mabwe na mibiki vizalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:11">na mapalo yezailumba nawo.<verse eid="HAB 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 2:12" />Kwizagaya weye uzenga bululu kwa kukoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:12">kozenga mabululu kwa mbuli zihile.<verse eid="HAB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 2:13" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kotenda nguvu za wanhu zage muna umoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:13">na wanhu wa zisi zimwenga wasang'hane bule.<verse eid="HAB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 2:14" />Ukulu wa Mndewa Mulungu wokwenela muna izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:14">fana viya mazi viyenela muna ibahali.<verse eid="HAB 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 2:15" />Kwizagaya weye uwang'wiza upele wakaya wayago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:15">iviya kowatenda wakoligwe kwa divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:15">muladi uwawone wahakala ukengele.<verse eid="HAB 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 2:16" />Kwizapata chinyala badala ya hishima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:16">kwizakung'wa upele mbaka kwizalagusa maungo yako yamateke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:16">Nhungo ya nhaguso ilawa muna umkono wa kulume wa Mndewa Mulungu yokwizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:16">chinyala chizaigubika hishima yako.<verse eid="HAB 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 2:17" />Mbuli za usede ziutendile Lebanoni zizakubwelela weye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:17">Ubananzi uuwatendele wanyama wizakutenda udumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:17">Mbuli izo zose zizakupata weye kwa ichimu cha ukomaji na magayo youtendile muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:17">vouyatendele mabululu na wanhu wose wokala umo.<verse eid="HAB 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 2:18" />Vino nyang'hiti za kutambikila zoyazisongole zofaya choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:18">Nyang'hiti ya mabwe ya kulumbuzuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:18">chinhu cha kupwililisa uvwizi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:18">Munhu yosongola nyang'hiti kohuwila nyang'hiti yoyaisongole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:18">na nyang'hiti haidaha kulonga.<verse eid="HAB 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 2:19" />Kezagaya munhu yodilongela gogo, ‘Lamka!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:19">Hebu yodilongela dibwe hadilonga, ‘Segela!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:19">Vino vinhu ivo vodaha kumfundiza munhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:19">Lola ihakigwa zahabu na hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:19">na yabule ugima.<verse eid="HAB 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAB 2:20" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kamuna ikaye yake yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:20">zisi zose zikale hupi kuulongozi wake.”<verse eid="HAB 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HAB 3" />
  <para style="s">Habakuki kompula Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 3:1" />Mulotezi Habakuki kompula Mndewa Mulungu, kokwimba kwa kuiyalala.<verse eid="HAB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 3:2" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu nihulika nhogolwa zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">nodumba mbuli ziutendile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">Uchitendele mbuli ziutendile umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">uchitende chizimanye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">Uhapata ludoko, chokulamba uchiwonele ubazi.<verse eid="HAB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 3:3" />Mulungu keza kulawa isi ya Temani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">Mulungu yelile keza kulawa mulima Palani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">Ukulu wake ugubika ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">isi imema nhogolwa zake.<verse eid="HAB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 3:4" />Bung'hulo jake dilinga fana da zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:4">milambi ya bung'hulo ilawa muna yamakono yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:4">niuko koyafisile nguvu zake.<verse eid="HAB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 3:5" />Utamu wa tauni umulongolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:5">mahulo yamsondelela.<verse eid="HAB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 3:6" />Kema na zisi zose zigudemeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">kalola zisi, nazo zigudemeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">Milima ya umwaka yotulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">vilima va umwaka viidulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">nzila zake zikala fana za umwaka.<verse eid="HAB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 3:7" />Niwona wanhu wa Kushani wogaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:7">wanhu wa Midiani wagudemeka.<verse eid="HAB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 3:8" />Vino weye Mndewa Mulungu viukwelile falasi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">na matololi yako ya kubululigwa na falasi muladi uhume</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">kuiwonela ludoko mizanda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">Vino kuyawonela ludoko mazi ya bahali?<verse eid="HAB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 3:9" />Kusasala upinde wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:9">kwika misale yako muna uluzabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:9">kutula isi kwa mizanda.<verse eid="HAB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 3:10" />Milima ikuwona igudemeka na mazi yakuluma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">Bahali ibuma na inula mawimbi yake.<verse eid="HAB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 3:11" />Mwezi na zuwa vihupika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:11">viviwonile misale ya lumwemwe wako yofosa himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:11">viviwonile mgoha wako viumelemeta.<verse eid="HAB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 3:12" />Kufosa muna iisi kwa ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:12">kuwabojoga wanhu wa zisi zimwenga kwa ng'hasiliki yako.<verse eid="HAB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 3:13" />Kulawa kuhita kuwakombola wanhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">kumkombola ija youmsagule kwa sang'hano yelile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">Kumuhonda mulangulizi wa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">kuwananga wanhu womsondelela.<verse eid="HAB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 3:14" />Kuhoma matwi ya watowang'hondo wake kwa migoha yake mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:14">wezile fana vulavumbi muladi wachipwililise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:14">kuno wodeng'helela kuwamela ngayengaye kwa kuwasepa.<verse eid="HAB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 3:15" />Kugenda uchanyha ya bahali kwa falasi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:15">na kuyatibula yamazi.<verse eid="HAB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 3:16" />Nihulika mbuli iyo na munda wangu wogudemeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">mulomo wangu wogudemeka kwa kudumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">Utamu wingila muna imivuha yangu na magulu yangu yogudemeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">Mbali nizakala hupi na kugozela siku ya magayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">yondaiwafikile waja wochitowa.<verse eid="HAB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 3:17" />Mnhini hawizakwalika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">mizabibu haizakwima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">mzaituni wizagaya bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">migunda haigala ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">muna ivikwama hamwizakuwa na ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">hebu muna yamabumba hamwizakuwa na ng'ombe.<verse eid="HAB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 3:18" />Mbali nizagendelela kumdeng'helela Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:18">nizamtowela ng'henze Mulungu mkombola wangu.<verse eid="HAB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 3:19" />Mulungu, Mndewa Mulungu niiyo yoning'ha nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:19">koigangamiza migulu yangu fana ya mhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:19">konidahiza kufosa uchanyha ya milima.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HAB 3:19" />
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:19">Kwa mulangulizi wa nyila. Kwa via va nyila va usingija.<verse eid="HAB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 3" />
</usx>